@startuml
' Architecture: the main parts of BudgetBite and how they depend on each other.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 70

component "BudgetBite\n(main)" as Main

package "UI" as UiPkg {
    component TextUi
}
package "Parser and Command" as CmdPkg {
    component Parser
    component Command
}
package "Navigation" as NavPkg {
    component MenuNavigator
    component FoodDirectory
}
package "Storage" as StoPkg {
    component StorageFile
}
package "Model" as Model {
    component RatingsManager
    component ExpensesManager
    component BudgetManager
}
database "data/*.txt" as Data

RatingsManager -[hidden]right- ExpensesManager
ExpensesManager -[hidden]right- BudgetManager

Main --> TextUi : reads input,\nshows responses
Main --> Parser : parses commands
Main --> Command : executes
Main --> MenuNavigator : navigation input
Main --> StorageFile : loads at start,\nsaves after each input

Parser .right.> Command : creates
MenuNavigator -right-> FoodDirectory
Command --> Model : reads and\nchanges data
Command --> FoodDirectory : checks names
MenuNavigator --> Model : adds ratings
StorageFile ..> Model : saves and loads
StorageFile --> Data : reads/writes
@enduml
